ques: Write a program to calculate sum first N terms of given series 1+ 1/2 + 1/3 + 1/4+..+1/n

Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);

int n = sc.nextInt();
double sum = 0;

for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {
    sum = sum + (1.0 / i);
}

System.out.println("Sum = " + sum);


ques: Write a program to calculate sum first N terms of given series 1 - 1/2 + 1/3- 1/4 +..+4n


Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);

int n = sc.nextInt();
double sum = 0;

for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {

    if (i % 2 == 0) {
        sum = sum - (1.0 / i);
    } 
    else {
        sum = sum + (1.0 / i);
    }
}

System.out.println("Sum = " + sum);
